\\"summary\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"summary_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"**Evaluating dependency options for testing**\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"summary_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"**Analyzing GraalVM version mismatch impact**\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"summary_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"**Tracing upstream ServiceLoaderFeature bug**\\\"}]}\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"The failure is an upstream Micronaut Core 5.1.3 issue, not a test failure.\\n\\n`ServiceLoaderFeature` receives an immutable `Map.of()` when no `META-INF/micronaut/` services exist, then unconditionally calls `computeIfAbsent`, causing the `UnsupportedOperationException` during native-image analysis.\\n\\nThe failure occurs before native tests execute, so changing test assertions or reachability metadata cannot resolve it. No repository files were changed.\", \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0909587d805e6a37016abf7ce449bc87d1bbd5c91f7127fcbc\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}], \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\", \"provider\": \"openai-codex\", \"model\": \"gpt-5.6-luna\", \"usage\": {\"input\": 766, \"output\": 1134, \"cacheRead\": 87552, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"reasoning\": 1034, \"totalTokens\": 89452, \"cost\": {\"input\": 0, \"output\": 0, \"cacheRead\": 0, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"total\": 0}}, \"stopReason\": \"stop\", \"timestamp\": 1790934224291, \"responseId\": \"resp_0909587d805e6a37016abf7cd0d5d887d1a700da751f274d7a\", \"rawStopReason\": \"completed\"}}\n39230:[recv] {\"type\": \"turn_end\", \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"thinking\", \"thinking\": \"**Planning test resource addition and annotation processing**\\n\\n**Evaluating annotation processor feasibility for test metadata**\\n\\n**Rejecting annotation processor workaround for native test**\", \"thinkingSignature\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0909587d805e6a37016abf7cd1786487d1962d582a9ee7125e\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"content\\\":[],\\\"encrypted_content\\\":\\\"gAAAAABqv3zaHOsgl